{c: Verse 1}
[C] [Em],        Har ghadi badal rahi hai roop zindagi
[C] [Em],        Chhaon hai kabhi kabhi hai dhoop zindagi
[F] [C],        Har pal yahan jeebhar jiyo
[F] [Gm] [C],        Jo hai sama kal ho naa ho
[G] [F],        Chaahe jo tumhe poore dil se
[G] [F] [C],        Milta hai voh mushkil se
[G] [F],        Aisa jo koi kahin hai
[G] [F] [C],        Bas vohi sab se haseen hai
[F] [C],        Us haath ko tum thaam lo
[F] [Gm] [C],        Voh meherbaan kal ho naa ho
[F] [C],        Har pal yahan jeebhar jiyo
[F] [Gm] [C],        Jo hai sama kal ho naa ho
[G] [F],        Ho, palkon ke leke saaye
[G] [F] [C],        Paas koi jo aaye
[G],        Laakh sambhaalo paagal dil ko
[G] [F] [C],        Dil dhadke hi jaaye
[F] [C],        Par soch lo is pal hai jo
[F] [Gm] [C],        Voh daastaan kal ho naa ho
